  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-starry-stage-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "9488f675cd007f4620369ab69109e899e1b1d016386aae90d9b8f678035cec6d",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "31d7e44f7c0afd1220ee7a46e57b7f98579a867573596831fc4db0494009a1ad",
      "text": "悟空的星星小剧场",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "adea336b192bbd19f50369f47752bf9d86745b695e2c36a776e53eed59724b59",
      "text": "今晚有故事会！\n悟空搭了一个小舞台，\n后面挂着一块蓝色幕布。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e7db02e622143b4b551919cb3eef0838a7c35d7b6c471e0ae48d2ebc4a00ddf9",
      "text": "悟空把纸星星贴到幕布上：\n一、二、三、四、五、六。\n舞台上亮着六颗星星。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "416f7f92e2dd0270ed7278f96b39c7c6fb885c45c5ba8a8c3031faa3547a64dd",
      "text": "玉兔蹦蹦跳跳地来了，\n手里拿着两颗星星：\n“我可以把它们加上去吗？”\n悟空说：“好呀！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "61eeb94e5f9233e91ac61f1d3df19c2c20b46b02b31c6a4c2122ac2ae78d60ec",
      "text": "玉兔又贴上两颗星星。\n六颗再加两颗，\n一共八颗！\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d17e3d430e0579ba3b72a32ec8545455ba3c0baddc0c964ade7df48733c78f93",
      "text": "八戒抱着故事书来了。\n他在入口停下来，\n那里只有一块光秃秃的小牌子。\n“故事会是在这里吗？”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2628ee66563f9e0c3bc2f363aa1bd288bfaee9babe7118c4d8e9806a1fc6034a",
      "text": "玉兔说：“入口也需要星星。”\n悟空说：“可是星星都用完了。”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3209e7a7a098265618bec086afd96bee1001715b50c9d7812c6d02b2a27b0084",
      "text": "悟空想到一个办法：\n“我们从幕布上拿下三颗吧。”\n一、二、三，拿下来啦！\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "99a833cf17bdebfc23059f88e2796e3fcc6c2b7f77140b02d984010a3f6f5501",
      "text": "幕布上还剩几颗？\n一、二、三、四、五。\n拿走三颗，还剩五颗。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "085ba6833faf6ba0af7dd5b79f277994c81886bd5c7c9343cd8a023d9dc63472",
      "text": "他们把三颗星星贴到小牌子上，\n入口也亮起来啦！\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef1ab4cc6ea0ddce97830670b70c6a81e3d9f1a6185bb329924869db688b8038",
      "text": "八戒有点担心：\n“我们是不是弄丢了三颗？”\n玉兔说：“没有呀，\n入口需要星星，\n我们只是给它们搬了个家。”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3b50211d4de1b1efd10348ac8593d64fbbf18da1658ee06149d492809bf898e2",
      "text": "悟空把星星都数了一遍：\n幕布上还剩五颗，\n入口有三颗，\n“还是一共八颗！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ffcbd9a15317e485a7de1917965a7dde0199d2da944b856860ddd3cff0c28251",
      "text": "八戒拍拍圆圆的肚子：\n“我的肚子能当月亮吗？”\n大家都笑了。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a12bf3159e18024bb6138be61334dc22a6a6209b51ae65161dbcd9501f6af280",
      "text": "悟空说：“月亮不是星星，\n所以还是八颗星星。”\n玉兔说：“还有一个肚子月亮！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "39862e6d01e53e47bd45ac61ad23b43035470e3ac31c8f2bda332ca44b51c705",
      "text": "舞台布置好了。\n玉兔和悟空坐到软垫上，\n八戒翻开故事书：\n“很久很久以前……”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0973f39cfb27b481d1a9308d097071b1d9f993c09d2a76e39e8a7ce7057d3915",
      "text": "故事讲完了，悟空抬头一看：\n天上亮起了真的星星。\n他小声说：“好多星星！”\n多得数也数不清！\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
